Z||000005||8Ball||08-08-2001||12:45 AM||||Oh yea just a side note.<P>It seems people who work in junkyards here in TN do NOT know how to pronounce Fiero. I had one guy ARGUE with me it was pronounced<BR>F-EYE-Aero. Of all things to argue about.<BR>Needless to say by the end of the convo he was NOT interested in selling me his 85 he had with no engine, transmission, or int  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Not that I wanted it but I figured for 50 bucks i could part it out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
